      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْرِيقٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْرِقٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْرُقَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also,
(M, O, K,) of a door, (M, K,) <i>A chink into
